  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; line-height: 21.3333339691162px;\">Fanzara ha vivido la noche de este martes una emotiva procesi&oacute;n del retorno del Sant&iacute;simo Sepulcro a su ermita, con la participaci&oacute;n de unas quinientas personas.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/10/IMG_7881.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; line-height: 21.3333339691162px;\">En todo momento la comitiva ha estado acompa&ntilde;ada por la Agrupaci&oacute;n Musical Virgen de Gracia de Vila-real, de cornetas y tambores, hasta el &#39;arrebato de fuego&#39; de Baldayo.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/procesionsantosepulcrofanzara14/img_7758.jpg\" alt=\"img_7758\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/procesionsantosepulcrofanzara14/img_7760.jpg\" alt=\"img_7760\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/procesionsantosepulcrofanzara14/img_7761.jpg\" alt=\"img_7761\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/procesionsantosepulcrofanzara14/img_7763.jpg\" alt=\"img_7763\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/procesionsantosepulcrofanzara14/img_7764.jpg\" alt=\"img_7764\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/procesionsantosepulcrofanzara14/img_7766.jpg\" alt=\"img_7766\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/procesionsantosepulcrofanzara14/img_7767.jpg\" alt=\"img_7767\